{"page":484,"width":1730,"height":2639,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"12 2 입출력 하드웨어 545","words":[{"text":"12","x":1142,"y":160,"width":37,"height":22},{"text":"2","x":1191,"y":160,"width":21,"height":22},{"text":"입출력","x":1229,"y":160,"width":67,"height":26},{"text":"하드웨어","x":1307,"y":159,"width":90,"height":26},{"text":"545","x":1469,"y":155,"width":58,"height":28}]},{"text":"이브를 위한 다음 대기 입출력을 시작시기는 일이다. 이 단계는 높은 우선순위를 가진다.","words":[{"text":"이브를","x":283,"y":288,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"위한","x":392,"y":289,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"다음","x":467,"y":288,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"대기","x":542,"y":289,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"입출력을","x":615,"y":288,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"시작시기는","x":747,"y":289,"width":152,"height":37},{"text":"일이다.","x":912,"y":288,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":1025,"y":288,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"단계는","x":1066,"y":288,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"높은","x":1172,"y":287,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"우선순위를","x":1248,"y":286,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"가진다.","x":1423,"y":286,"width":104,"height":37}]},{"text":"왜냐하면 디스크가 효과적으로 久卜%되려면 이전 입출력이 끝나자마자 바로 다음 입출력","words":[{"text":"왜냐하면","x":282,"y":348,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"디스크가","x":425,"y":349,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"효과적으로","x":561,"y":348,"width":154,"height":36},{"text":"久卜%되려면","x":727,"y":348,"width":150,"height":37},{"text":"이전","x":892,"y":349,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"입출력이","x":967,"y":348,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"끝나자마자","x":1102,"y":346,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"바로","x":1277,"y":347,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"다음","x":1354,"y":346,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"입출력","x":1433,"y":347,"width":91,"height":36}]},{"text":"을 시작시킬 필요가 있기 때문이다. 따라서 커널 고-드는 두 개의 인터럽트 핸들러로 디","words":[{"text":"을","x":280,"y":408,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"시작시킬","x":328,"y":408,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"필요가","x":472,"y":408,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"있기","x":580,"y":408,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"때문이다.","x":655,"y":408,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"따라서","x":797,"y":408,"width":87,"height":37},{"text":"커널","x":902,"y":408,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"고-드는","x":977,"y":409,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"두","x":1084,"y":408,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"개의","x":1130,"y":407,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"인터럽트","x":1209,"y":407,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"핸들러로","x":1352,"y":406,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"디","x":1497,"y":407,"width":26,"height":35}]},{"text":"스크 읽기를 나누어 실행한다. 높은 우선순위 핸들러는 입출력 상태를 기록하고, 장치 인","words":[{"text":"스크","x":280,"y":470,"width":64,"height":27},{"text":"읽기를","x":359,"y":468,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"나누어","x":466,"y":467,"width":89,"height":37},{"text":"실행한다.","x":571,"y":467,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"높은","x":713,"y":469,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"우선순위","x":785,"y":468,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"핸들러는","x":918,"y":467,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"입출력","x":1055,"y":467,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"상태를","x":1160,"y":467,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"기록하고,","x":1270,"y":467,"width":135,"height":36},{"text":"장치","x":1418,"y":466,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"인","x":1498,"y":466,"width":30,"height":35}]},{"text":"터럽트를 소거하고, 다음의 대기 중인 입출력을 시작하고, 작업을 완료하기 위해 낮은 우","words":[{"text":"터럽트를","x":281,"y":527,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"소거하고,","x":421,"y":528,"width":135,"height":35},{"text":"다음의","x":569,"y":528,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"대기","x":674,"y":528,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"중인","x":744,"y":528,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"입출력을","x":818,"y":528,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"시작하고,","x":950,"y":527,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"작업을","x":1094,"y":527,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"완료하기","x":1201,"y":527,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"위해","x":1343,"y":527,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"낮은","x":1420,"y":526,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"우","x":1496,"y":526,"width":34,"height":36}]},{"text":"선순위의 인터럽트를 요청한다. 나중에 (CPU가 높