1388,"y":707,"width":140,"height":37}]},{"text":"지금까지 잠자던 프로그램을 준비 #(ready queue)로 옮기고, 스케줄러를 호출하","words":[{"text":"지금까지","x":278,"y":765,"width":126,"height":37},{"text":"잠자던","x":420,"y":766,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"프로그램을","x":604,"y":767,"width":155,"height":35},{"text":"준비","x":770,"y":767,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"#(ready","x":843,"y":769,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"queue)로","x":985,"y":769,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"옮기고,","x":1138,"y":767,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"스케줄러를","x":1255,"y":767,"width":163,"height":36},{"text":"호출하","x":1430,"y":768,"width":99,"height":36}]},{"text":"는 등의 시급하지 않은 잔무를 처리함으로써 입력 작업을 종료한다.","words":[{"text":"는","x":276,"y":827,"width":33,"height":33},{"text":"등의","x":320,"y":826,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"시급하지","x":399,"y":826,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"않은","x":540,"y":827,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"잔무를","x":612,"y":828,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"처리함으로써","x":718,"y":827,"width":180,"height":37},{"text":"입력","x":915,"y":827,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"작업을","x":985,"y":826,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"종료한다.","x":1088,"y":827,"width":132,"height":37}]},{"text":"스레드를 구현한 커널은 여러 단계의 우선순위를 가지는 인터럽트 처리를 구현하","words":[{"text":"스레드를","x":337,"y":886,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"구현한","x":484,"y":887,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"커널은","x":598,"y":887,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"여러","x":707,"y":887,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"단계의","x":783,"y":887,"width":89,"height":37},{"text":"우선순위를","x":891,"y":887,"width":155,"height":36},{"text":"가지는","x":1062,"y":887,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"인터럽트","x":1173,"y":888,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"처리를","x":1316,"y":888,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"구현하","x":1429,"y":888,"width":100,"height":36}]},{"text":"거나 커널 내의 백그라운드 처리나 우일 루틴보다 인터럽트 핸들링에 우선권을 부여하","words":[{"text":"거나","x":277,"y":946,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"커널","x":358,"y":946,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"내의","x":438,"y":947,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"백그라운드","x":516,"y":947,"width":156,"height":36},{"text":"처리나","x":688,"y":947,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"우일","x":792,"y":947,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"루틴보다","x":869,"y":947,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"인터럽트","x":1008,"y":947,"width":122,"height":37},{"text":"핸들링에","x":1145,"y":947,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"우선권을","x":1285,"y":947,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"부여하","x":1430,"y":948,"width":100,"height":36}]},{"text":"는 데 적합하다. 아래에서는 Solaris 커널로 이러한 개념을 소개한다. Solaris에서 각 인","words":[{"text":"는","x":275,"y":1008,"width":34,"height":33},{"text":"데","x":322,"y":1006,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"적합하다.","x":368,"y":1007,"width":134,"height":36},{"text":"아래에서는","x":517,"y":1008,"width":157,"height":35},{"text":"Solaris","x":684,"y":1010,"width":105,"height":29},{"text":"커널로","x":804,"y":1008,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"이러한","x":909,"y":1008,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"개념을","x":1013,"y":1008,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"소개한다.","x":1116,"y":1008,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"Solaris에서","x":1262,"y":1008,"width":172,"height":35},{"text":"각","x":1451,"y":1008,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"인","x":1498,"y":1008,"width":30,"height":35}]},{"text":"터럽트 핸들러는 각 하나의 커널 스레드에 대응된다. 이 스레드들은 각기 높은 스케줄링","words":[{"text":"터럽트","x":277,"y":1066,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"핸들러는","x":387,"y":1067,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"각","x":528,"y":1068,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"하나의","x":572,"y":1068,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"커널","x":679,"y":1068,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"스레드에","x":751,"y":1068,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"대응된다.","x":888,"y":1068,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1034,"y":1068,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"스레드들은","x":1075,"y":1068,"width":157,"height":35},{"text":"각기","x":1243,"y":1069,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"높은","x":1319,"y":1068,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"스케줄링","x":1398,"y":1068,"width":128,"height":36}]},{"text":"우선순위를 배정받는다. 스레드들의 높은 우선순위는 스레드에 대응되는 인터럽트